# The Core adds as many mana as there are permanent cards in the graveyard, here exactly one. Matzalantli transforms on turn 3 (four
# permanent types in the graveyard); on turn 4 Bot2's Tormod's Crypt exiles Bot1's graveyard and then its Mind Twist for X = 1 makes Bot1
# discard its only card, a Plains. On turn 5 The Core adds a single Red, the instant Mind Twist in Bot2's graveyard counting for nothing.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Matzalantli, the Great Door
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Thought Scour
Pacifism
Savannah Lions
Plains
Mox Ruby
Plains x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Tormod's Crypt
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mind Twist
Plains x20

